# Rust build output (large, regenerated by `cargo build`)
/target/

# Node dependencies (regenerated by `npm install`)
**/node_modules/

# The product bundle (dist/SNSSecurityAgent + zip) and the built admin UI
# (admin-ui/dist, embedded into sns-admin at compile) ARE committed intentionally.

